id: pm-web-lx5w
title: CodeQL action updates split into mutually blocking pull requests
description: Dependabot updates the CodeQL init and analyze actions separately even though CodeQL requires every action in a workflow to use the same release. Bump the pair together and group future github/codeql-action updates into one pull request.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-08-30T16:04:36.299Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-30T16:19:30.304Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-30T16:14:24.328Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-30T16:14:24.328Z"
claim_principal: pi-agent
author: pi-agent
comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-30T16:14:15.491Z",pi-agent,"Updated every github/codeql-action reference from v4.37.8 to v4.37.9 at commit cdf488f595d80d6e07e03d4674febd5ab45fa938 and added the Dependabot codeql-action group. node --test test/workflow-security.test.ts passed 3/3; npm run typecheck passed; npm run docstring reported 85 files and 587 documented declarations. Regression proof: temporarily reverting analyze to v4.37.8 made the new same-release test fail (2 revisions !== 1), then restoring v4.37.9 made it pass. A full local npm test run reached 425 passing tests; unrelated fleet-catalog checks detected the separately tracked pm-web-bw5d catalog drift and one timing-sensitive pm-runner test, which passed alone."
  "2026-08-30T16:19:30.304Z",pi-agent,"Greptile's formatting-sensitivity finding was valid. Replaced the raw Dependabot YAML regex with structural parsing through the repository's existing yaml dependency; the focused workflow-security suite, typecheck, and docstring gate all pass."
files[3]{path,scope,note}:
  .github/workflows/codeql.yml,project,Pins init and analyze to one reviewed CodeQL release
  .github/dependabot.yml,project,Groups future CodeQL action updates
  test/workflow-security.test.ts,project,Guards same-version and grouped-update invariants
